.TH SHADERSCOPE 1 "2026-05-19" "ShaderScope" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
shaderscope \- GPU shader overlay using Vulkan + SDL3
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B shaderscope
.RB [ --capture
.IR kind ]
.RB [ --source
.IR id ]
.RB [ --preset
.IR preset.slangp ]
.RI [ image.png ]
.br
.B shaderscope
.B --list-sources
.RB [ --capture
.IR kind ]
.br
.B shaderscope
.B --headless --input
.I file.png
.B --output
.I file.png
.RB [ --preset
.IR preset.slangp ]
.RB [ --width
.IR N ]
.RB [ --height
.IR N ]
.br
.B shaderscope
.B --compile-preset
.I preset.slangp
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B shaderscope
applies RetroArch
.I slang
shaders as a real-time overlay over captured desktop content. Capture sources
include the X11 root window or composited child windows via XComposite+XShm,
and Wayland screens via xdg-desktop-portal screencast + PipeWire (with
DMA-BUF zero-copy when available).
.PP
The renderer uses Vulkan 1.3 dynamic rendering with SDL3 for window
management. The UI is Dear ImGui — source picker, preset browser,
per-shader parameter editor, drag-and-drop preset import, crop overlay,
toast notifications, screenshot capture.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --capture " kind"
Capture backend. One of
.BR x11-screen ", " wayland-screen .
If omitted on a bare launch, the GUI source picker selects.
.TP
.BI --source " id"
Source identifier (e.g.
.BR monitor:root )
or substring match against window names. Use
.B --list-sources
to enumerate.
.TP
.BI --preset " preset.slangp"
Path to a RetroArch
.I .slangp
preset file. Loaded at startup; multi-pass presets supported.
.TP
.B --list-sources
List sources for the current capture backend and exit (script-friendly).
.TP
.B --headless
Render a single frame to a PNG and exit. Requires
.B --input
and
.BR --output ;
ignores everything else GUI-related.
.TP
.BI --input " file.png"
Headless input image (PNG).
.TP
.BI --output " file.png"
Headless output image (PNG).
.TP
.BI --width " N" ", " --height " N"
Override the headless output dimensions.
.TP
.BI --compile-preset " preset.slangp"
Parse and compile the preset, print pass info, exit. No render.
.TP
.B --reset-config
Delete
.I ~/.config/shaderscope/config.json
before launch (resets session restore).
.TP
.B --debug-portal
Probe the xdg-desktop-portal screencast interface, print the resulting
PipeWire fd, and exit.
.TP
.B -h ", " --help
Show usage and exit.
.TP
.B -V ", " --version
Print version + commit + build date and exit.
.SH HOTKEYS
Bound in the window when ImGui does not have keyboard focus.
.TP
.B F11
Take a screenshot (saved under
.IR $XDG_PICTURES_DIR ", " $HOME/Pictures ", or " $HOME ).
.TP
.B B
Toggle bypass (active preset ⇄ passthrough). Second press restores the prior preset.
.TP
.B "[ , ]"
Cycle to the previous / next preset in the library scan order. PageUp/PageDown also work.
.TP
.B F1
Show a hotkey-help toast.
.TP
.B F2
Hide / show ImGui chrome — useful for overlay-style use.
.TP
.B F3
Toggle window always-on-top.
.TP
.B F4
Toggle borderless (no window decorations).
.TP
.B Esc
Close the window.
.PP
Dropping a
.I .slangp
file onto the window imports it (case-insensitive).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SHADERSCOPE_LOG
Threshold for stderr logging. One of
.BR debug ", " info ", " warn ", " error ", " off .
Defaults to
.BR info .
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
If set, ShaderScope reads/writes
.IB $XDG_CONFIG_HOME /shaderscope/
instead of
.IR $HOME/.config/shaderscope/ .
.TP
.B XDG_PICTURES_DIR
Override directory for screenshots. ShaderScope also reads
.I ~/.config/user-dirs.dirs
to find this value.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/shaderscope/config.json
Session state — last source, last preset, per-source crop rectangles,
parameter overrides. Migrated automatically from
.I ~/.config/shaderglass/
on first launch if the legacy directory exists.
.TP
.I ~/.config/shaderscope/imgui.ini
ImGui window layout.
.TP
.IR $XDG_DATA_DIRS /shaderscope/shaders/
Installed starter shader presets. The dev binary also probes the build
tree's
.I shaders-staging/
directory first.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Auto-launch GUI (resumes last session):
.RS
.EX
$ shaderscope
.EE
.RE
.PP
Capture the X11 root window with a CRT preset:
.RS
.EX
$ shaderscope --capture x11-screen --source monitor:root \\
    --preset /usr/share/shaderscope/shaders/crt-easymode.slangp
.EE
.RE
.PP
Headless one-shot render:
.RS
.EX
$ shaderscope --headless --input in.png --output out.png \\
    --preset some-preset.slangp
.EE
.RE
